Upstream:      Ceph's vendored Intel qatlib and QATzip: src/qatlib/autogen.sh,
               src/qatzip/autogen.sh; nixpkgs pkgs/by-name/ce/ceph
Upstreamable:  yes; already fixed in Intel's repos and Ceph main, not in any
               stable branch
How:           Issues filed: NixOS/nixpkgs#576414 and
               https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/81385 (backport to umbrella and
               tentacle requested). Ceph main has it via ceph/ceph#72402, a QATzip
               major-version bump, so a shebang-only backport may suit the stable
               branches better. Until a release reaches nixpkgs, nixpkgs could
               carry this patch in src.nix.
Written:       2026-10-15, against Ceph 20.2.4 (nixpkgs)
Last checked:  2026-10-25: nixpkgs still at 20.2.4 without a fix; #576414 open
Remove when:   nixpkgs' ceph builds without it (patches/ceph-overlay.nix throws
               once nixpkgs' ceph files mention autogen, and this patch stops
               applying if the tarball fixes the files)
Applied by:    patches/ceph-overlay.nix

Moves the #!/bin/sh line of the bundled qatlib and qatzip autogen.sh files
above Intel's license header, where it sits on line 36. cmake runs ./autogen.sh
as qatlib_ext's configure command, execve returns ENOEXEC, and the build stops
at ~4% with "Command failed (exec format error)". patchShebangs only rewrites a
shebang on line 1.

The files were always broken; libuv 1.53.0 exposed them. cmake spawns through
libuv, which until 1.52.1 used fork and glibc's execvp (which reruns an ENOEXEC
file with /bin/sh). 1.53.0 (libuv#3520) uses posix_spawn on Linux, and glibc's
posix_spawn has not retried through the shell since 2.15.

diff -ru a/src/qatlib/autogen.sh b/src/qatlib/autogen.sh
--- a/src/qatlib/autogen.sh
+++ b/src/qatlib/autogen.sh
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#!/bin/sh
 #################################################################
 #
 #   BSD LICENSE
@@ -33,6 +34,5 @@
 # 
 #
 #################################################################
-#!/bin/sh
 
 autoreconf -if
diff -ru a/src/qatzip/autogen.sh b/src/qatzip/autogen.sh
--- a/src/qatzip/autogen.sh
+++ b/src/qatzip/autogen.sh
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#!/bin/sh
 ################################################################
 #   BSD LICENSE
